Chief Shartu~
Shartu, Chieftain of the Bhyroga, looks towards you for help.
~
A stocky man with blonde hair and deep blue eyes, Shartu looks as if he's seen
more of the world than his fellow villagers. His face holds a pained look as
he thinks of all the tragedies happening now. His eyes plead for your help in
freeing him from the terrible ice giants.
~
