#4209
dragon ice kaerdein~
Kaerdein, the Ice Dragon~
A dragon as white and clear as ice rises up before you.
~
A snaking iceberg stretches across the cavern floor, pale-blue shadows and
sparkling, silver streaks highlighting frost-white scales. His blunt wedge of
a head sweeps back in silver-tipped fringe from his glassy brow and jaws of
glistening fangs, his massive head crowned by a pair of twisted, crystalline
horns.
~
